# Line endings.
#
# Everything is normalised to LF in the repository. Files that are executed or
# parsed inside Linux containers are also forced to LF in the working tree,
# whatever the checkout platform: with Git for Windows' default
# core.autocrlf=true they were checked out as CRLF, the entrypoint's shebang
# became `bash\r`, and an API image built from a Windows clone could never start.
* text=auto

*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
Caddyfile   text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.tf        text eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pkl  binary
